{% doc %}
  @prompt
    ### Updated Shopify AI Prompt
    
    Update the existing **RootSyntax Contact Us section** with a premium dark, modern UI. Keep the existing content and functionality, but refine the layout and styling.
    
    **Design**
    
    * Background: `#050505`
    * Two-column desktop layout: 65% form / 35% contact info
    * Max-width: 1400px
    * Card background: `#0F0F12`
    * Border: `rgba(255,255,255,0.08)`
    * Border radius: 20–24px
    * Accent colors: Orange `#FF7A00` and Purple `#6C4CFF`
    * White headings and light-gray body text
    * Responsive on mobile
    
    **Contact Form**
    
    * Heading: **GET IN TOUCH**
    * Name, Email, Phone Number and Message fields
    * Project Timeline options: ⚡ ASAP, 📅 1–2 Months, 🚀 3–6 Months
    * Selected timeline gets an orange border/glow
    * Book A Time Slot: Date, Time and AM/PM
    * Full-width **SEND** button using an orange-to-purple gradient
    * Keep the existing consent/privacy text
    
    **Contact Information**
    Heading: **WE'D LOVE TO HEAR FROM YOU.**
    
    Create clean cards for:
    
    **WORKING HOURS**
    Monday to Friday – 9:30 am to 4 pm EST
    
    **EMAIL US**
    [info@rootsyntax.com](mailto:info@rootsyntax.com)
    
    **CONTACT NUMBER:**
    +1 352-218-5661
    
    Use consistent orange gradient circular icons with white icons.
    
    **Office Locations**
    
    Create two clean stacked cards:
    
    **USA, FLORIDA**
    6160 SW Highway 200
    Ste. 110 PMB508
    Ocala, FL 34486
    7901 4TH ST N STE 300,
    Saint Petersburg, FL 33702
    
    **INDIA, BANGALORE**
    91 Springboard Business Hub Private Ltd.,512/10,
    Service Lane,
    Outer Ring Road,
    Mahadevapura,
    Bangalore 560048
    
    For both location cards:
    
    * Use a location-pin icon inside an orange circular background
    * Keep the icon on the left and address on the right
    * **REMOVE the orange arrow/chevron completely**
    * **Do not add any arrow, chevron, link icon, or directional icon**
    * Cards should be informational, not clickable
    * Add only a subtle hover lift/glow
    
    **Trust Card**
    Add:
    ★★★★★
    **146+ Shopify Projects Delivered**
    98% Client Satisfaction
    
    Include a subtle orange-to-purple gradient progress bar.
    
    **Customization**
    Make headings, labels, contact information, addresses, button text, colors, spacing, card radius, gradients, and trust card visibility editable through the Shopify Theme Editor.
    
    **Important:** Keep the design minimal and premium. Do not introduce unnecessary icons or decorative elements. **The USA and India address cards must have NO arrows on the right side.**
    
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .rs-contact-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.background_color }};
    padding: {{ block.settings.section_padding_top }}px 20px {{ block.settings.section_padding_bottom }}px;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .rs-contact-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: {{ block.settings.max_width }}px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 65% 35%;
    gap: 40px;
  }

  .rs-contact-form-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background: {{ block.settings.card_background }};
    border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.card_border_color }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.card_border_radius }}px;
    padding: 48px;
  }

  .rs-contact-form-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.form_heading_size }}px;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin: 0 0 32px 0;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
  }

  .rs-contact-form-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .rs-contact-form-row-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .rs-contact-form-group-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .rs-contact-form-label-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.label_color }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.label_size }}px;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .rs-contact-form-input-{{ ai_gen_id }},
  .rs-contact-form-textarea-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background: {{ block.settings.input_background }};
    border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.input_border_color }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.input_border_radius }}px;
    padding: 14px 16px;
    color: {{ block.settings.input_text_color }};
    font-size: 14px;
    transition: border-color 0.3s ease;
  }

  .rs-contact-form-input-{{ ai_gen_id }}:focus,
  .rs-contact-form-textarea-{{ ai_gen_id }}:focus {
    outline: none;
    border-color: {{ block.settings.accent_orange }};
  }

  .rs-contact-form-textarea-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    min-height: 120px;
    resize: vertical;
  }

  .rs-contact-timeline-label-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.label_color }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.label_size }}px;
    font-weight: 500;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .rs-contact-timeline-options-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .rs-contact-timeline-option-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
  }

  .rs-contact-timeline-input-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    opacity: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .rs-contact-timeline-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 14px 16px;
    background: {{ block.settings.input_background }};
    border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.input_border_color }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.input_border_radius }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.input_text_color }};
    font-size: 14px;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .rs-contact-timeline-input-{{ ai_gen_id }}:checked + .rs-contact-timeline-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    border-color: {{ block.settings.accent_orange }};
    box-shadow: 0 0 12px {{ block.settings.accent_orange }}40;
    background: {{ block.settings.accent_orange }}10;
  }

  .rs-contact-booking-row-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .rs-contact-submit-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 16px 32px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, {{ block.settings.accent_orange }} 0%, {{ block.settings.accent_purple }} 100%);
    border: none;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.button_border_radius }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.button_text_color }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.button_text_size }}px;
    font-weight: 600;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }

  .rs-contact-submit-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px {{ block.settings.accent_orange }}40;
  }

  .rs-contact-consent-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.body_text_color }};
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-top: 16px;
  }

  .rs-contact-consent-{{ ai_gen_id }} a {
    color: {{ block.settings.accent_orange }};
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .rs-contact-info-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .rs-contact-info-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.info_heading_size }}px;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.3;
    margin: 0 0 24px 0;
  }

  .rs-contact-info-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background: {{ block.settings.card_background }};
    border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.card_border_color }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.card_border_radius }}px;
    padding: 24px;
    transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
  }

  .rs-contact-info-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px {{ block.settings.accent_orange }}20;
  }

  .rs-contact-info-item-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .rs-contact-info-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, {{ block.settings.accent_orange }} 0%, {{ block.settings.accent_purple }} 100%);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .rs-contact-info-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 24px;
    height: 24px;
    stroke: white;
    fill: none;
  }

  .rs-contact-info-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex: 1;
  }

  .rs-contact-info-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 0 0 8px 0;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }

  .rs-contact-info-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.body_text_color }};
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .rs-contact-info-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} a {
    color: {{ block.settings.body_text_color }};
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.3s ease;
  }

  .rs-contact-info-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} a:hover {
    color: {{ block.settings.accent_orange }};
  }

  .rs-contact-location-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background: {{ block.settings.card_background }};
    border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.card_border_color }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.card_border_radius }}px;
    padding: 24px;
    transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
  }

  .rs-contact-location-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px {{ block.settings.accent_orange }}20;
  }

  .rs-contact-location-item-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .rs-contact-location-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: {{ block.settings.accent_orange }};
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .rs-contact-location-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 24px;
    height: 24px;
    stroke: white;
    fill: none;
  }

  .rs-contact-location-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex: 1;
  }

  .rs-contact-location-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 0 0 8px 0;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }

  .rs-contact-location-address-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.body_text_color }};
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .rs-contact-trust-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background: {{ block.settings.card_background }};
    border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.card_border_color }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.card_border_radius }}px;
    padding: 24px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .rs-contact-trust-stars-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.accent_orange }};
    font-size: 24px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .rs-contact-trust-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 0 0 4px 0;
  }

  .rs-contact-trust-subtext-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.body_text_color }};
    font-size: 14px;
    margin: 0 0 16px 0;
  }

  .rs-contact-trust-progress-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: 6px;
    background: {{ block.settings.input_background }};
    border-radius: 3px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .rs-contact-trust-progress-bar-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    height: 100%;
    width: 98%;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, {{ block.settings.accent_orange }} 0%, {{ block.settings.accent_purple }} 100%);
    border-radius: 3px;
  }

  .rs-contact-success-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background: #10b98140;
    border: 1px solid #10b981;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.input_border_radius }}px;
    padding: 16px;
    color: #10b981;
    font-size: 14px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .rs-contact-error-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background: #ef444440;
    border: 1px solid #ef4444;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.input_border_radius }}px;
    padding: 16px;
    color: #ef4444;
    font-size: 14px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 989px) {
    .rs-contact-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .rs-contact-form-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 32px 24px;
    }

    .rs-contact-form-row-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .rs-contact-timeline-options-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .rs-contact-booking-row-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<rs-contact-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="rs-contact-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="rs-contact-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <div class="rs-contact-form-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <h2 class="rs-contact-form-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.form_heading }}</h2>

      {%- form 'contact' -%}
        {%- if form.posted_successfully? -%}
          <div class="rs-contact-success-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ block.settings.success_message }}
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- if form.errors -%}
          <div class="rs-contact-error-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ form.errors.messages | first }}
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}

        <div class="rs-contact-form-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <div class="rs-contact-form-row-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <div class="rs-contact-form-group-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <label class="rs-contact-form-label-{{ ai_gen_id }}" for="contact-name-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ block.settings.name_label }}
              </label>
              <input
                type="text"
                id="contact-name-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                name="contact[name]"
                class="rs-contact-form-input-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                placeholder="{{ block.settings.name_placeholder }}"
                required
              >
            </div>

            <div class="rs-contact-form-group-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <label class="rs-contact-form-label-{{ ai_gen_id }}" for="contact-email-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ block.settings.email_label }}
              </label>
              <input
                type="email"
                id="contact-email-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                name="contact[email]"
                class="rs-contact-form-input-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                placeholder="{{ block.settings.email_placeholder }}"
                required
              >
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="rs-contact-form-group-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <label class="rs-contact-form-label-{{ ai_gen_id }}" for="contact-phone-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {{ block.settings.phone_label }}
            </label>
            <input
              type="tel"
              id="contact-phone-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
              name="contact[phone]"
              class="rs-contact-form-input-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
              placeholder="{{ block.settings.phone_placeholder }}"
            >
          </div>

          <div class="rs-contact-form-group-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <label class="rs-contact-form-label-{{ ai_gen_id }}" for="contact-message-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {{ block.settings.message_label }}
            </label>
            <textarea
              id="contact-message-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
              name="contact[body]"
              class="rs-contact-form-textarea-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
              placeholder="{{ block.settings.message_placeholder }}"
              required
            ></textarea>
          </div>

          <div class="rs-contact-form-group-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <div class="rs-contact-timeline-label-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.timeline_label }}</div>
            <div class="rs-contact-timeline-options-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <div class="rs-contact-timeline-option-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                <input
                  type="radio"
                  id="timeline-asap-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                  name="contact[timeline]"
                  value="ASAP"
                  class="rs-contact-timeline-input-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                >
                <label for="timeline-asap-{{ ai_gen_id }}" class="rs-contact-timeline-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  {{ block.settings.timeline_option_1 }}
                </label>
              </div>

              <div class="rs-contact-timeline-option-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                <input
                  type="radio"
                  id="timeline-1-2-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                  name="contact[timeline]"
                  value="1-2 Months"
                  class="rs-contact-timeline-input-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                >
                <label for="timeline-1-2-{{ ai_gen_id }}" class="rs-contact-timeline-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  {{ block.settings.timeline_option_2 }}
                </label>
              </div>

              <div class="rs-contact-timeline-option-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                <input
                  type="radio"
                  id="timeline-3-6-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                  name="contact[timeline]"
                  value="3-6 Months"
                  class="rs-contact-timeline-input-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                >
                <label for="timeline-3-6-{{ ai_gen_id }}" class="rs-contact-timeline-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  {{ block.settings.timeline_option_3 }}
                </label>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="rs-contact-form-group-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <label class="rs-contact-form-label-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.booking_label }}</label>
            <div class="rs-contact-booking-row-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <input
                type="text"
                name="contact[booking_date]"
                class="rs-contact-form-input-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                placeholder="{{ block.settings.date_placeholder }}"
              >
              <input
                type="text"
                name="contact[booking_time]"
                class="rs-contact-form-input-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                placeholder="{{ block.settings.time_placeholder }}"
              >
              <select name="contact[booking_period]" class="rs-contact-form-input-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                <option value="AM">AM</option>
                <option value="PM">PM</option>
              </select>
            </div>
          </div>

          <button type="submit" class="rs-contact-submit-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ block.settings.submit_button_text }}
          </button>

          <div class="rs-contact-consent-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ block.settings.consent_text }}
          </div>
        </div>
      {%- endform -%}
    </div>

    <div class="rs-contact-info-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <h2 class="rs-contact-info-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.info_heading }}</h2>

      <div class="rs-contact-info-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <div class="rs-contact-info-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <div class="rs-contact-info-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle>
              <polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"></polyline>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="rs-contact-info-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <h3 class="rs-contact-info-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.hours_title }}</h3>
            <p class="rs-contact-info-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.hours_text }}</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="rs-contact-info-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <div class="rs-contact-info-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <div class="rs-contact-info-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M4 4h16c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2v12c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2H4c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V6c0-1.1.9-2 2-2z"></path>
              <polyline points="22,6 12,13 2,6"></polyline>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="rs-contact-info-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <h3 class="rs-contact-info-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.email_title }}</h3>
            <p class="rs-contact-info-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <a href="mailto:{{ block.settings.email_address }}">{{ block.settings.email_address }}</a>
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="rs-contact-info-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <div class="rs-contact-info-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <div class="rs-contact-info-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 .7 2.81 2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="rs-contact-info-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <h3 class="rs-contact-info-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.phone_title }}</h3>
            <p class="rs-contact-info-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <a href="tel:{{ block.settings.phone_number }}">{{ block.settings.phone_number }}</a>
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="rs-contact-location-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <div class="rs-contact-location-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <div class="rs-contact-location-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M21 10c0 7-9 13-9 13s-9-6-9-13a9 9 0 0 1 18 0z"></path>
              <circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"></circle>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="rs-contact-location-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <h3 class="rs-contact-location-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.usa_location_title }}</h3>
            <p class="rs-contact-location-address-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.usa_address }}</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="rs-contact-location-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <div class="rs-contact-location-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <div class="rs-contact-location-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M21 10c0 7-9 13-9 13s-9-6-9-13a9 9 0 0 1 18 0z"></path>
              <circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"></circle>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="rs-contact-location-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <h3 class="rs-contact-location-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.india_location_title }}</h3>
            <p class="rs-contact-location-address-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.india_address }}</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      {% if block.settings.show_trust_card %}
        <div class="rs-contact-trust-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <div class="rs-contact-trust-stars-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.trust_stars }}</div>
          <p class="rs-contact-trust-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.trust_text }}</p>
          <p class="rs-contact-trust-subtext-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.trust_subtext }}</p>
          <div class="rs-contact-trust-progress-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <div class="rs-contact-trust-progress-bar-{{ ai_gen_id }}"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </div>
</rs-contact-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

<script>
  (function() {
    class RsContact{{ ai_gen_id }} extends HTMLElement {
      constructor() {
        super();
      }

      connectedCallback() {
        this.setupTimelineButtons();
      }

      setupTimelineButtons() {
        const timelineInputs = this.querySelectorAll('.rs-contact-timeline-input-{{ ai_gen_id }}');
        
        timelineInputs.forEach(input => {
          const label = input.nextElementSibling;
          
          label.addEventListener('click', () => {
            input.checked = true;
          });
        });
      }
    }

    customElements.define('rs-contact-{{ ai_gen_id }}', RsContact{{ ai_gen_id }});
  })();
</script>

